title: "VBT Studio: barbell velocity tracking from a phone video"
abstract: >-
  Computer-vision pipeline for velocity-based training: YOLO plate detection,
  Kalman / Hungarian / ByteTrack-style tracking, pixel-to-metre calibration and
  per-rep velocity metrics from an ordinary phone video.
